cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Lynx in research or a product, please cite it as below."
title: "Lynx: deterministic repository intelligence for AI-native tooling"
abstract: >-
  Lynx is a local-first repository intelligence engine. It indexes a source
  tree into stable symbols, coordinates, structural relations, and embeddings,
  then exposes retrieval through a CLI and a stdio Model Context Protocol
  server. Lynx discovers evidence; consumers decide.
type: software
